      "content": "That makes sense. One more thing—the reaction feels almost \"sudden\" or \"unpredictable\" when you're working with them in the kitchen, like it's almost attacking you out of nowhere. Is there anything in the kinetics of the reaction or the way the gas disperses that explains that sudden, sharp onset of the stinging sensation?",
